# Pairs with GateOwnership. Two splits of one leaf under a single gate is exactly what the gate exists to prevent.
MODULE: CaptureIgnoresBusyGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a capture takes the split gate while another turn holds it
PERTURBS: CaptureTakeGate

--- FIND
    /\ cap[l] = "split"
    /\ gate[l] = "free"
--- REPLACE
    /\ cap[l] = "split"
    \* MUTATION: the gate is not checked
--- END
